                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ce992f4-897c-4f3e-b7d5-70ee4ccf0ea5",
                                                "sense_id": "38b0d4a9-bb43-3338-bfe1-b73ff65cbdb4",
                                                "text": "It is singular how forcibly this passage in my narrative brings to my mind a picture which used to be, some years ago, at a broker's—that charnel-house of the comforts and graces of life. It had been taken out of its frame, and leant in a dark and dusty corner against a perpendicular armchair, whose rigid uprightness seemed suited only to the parlour of a dentist, repose being the last idea it suggested."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "810cd3c4-50a0-4706-a1c4-b5a01901811c",
                                                "sense_id": "38b0d4a9-bb43-3338-bfe1-b73ff65cbdb4",
                                                "text": "Thus Django becomes the carrier of the “public use of one's reason”—the Kantian road to enlightenment given to him by the German “Forty-Eighter” dentist–turned-bounty hunter Dr. “King” Schultz, and represents the fictive, allohistorical beginning of the battle against slavery and racism in the United States."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "96427021-b589-33a7-9cf5-eccaacaee8d5",
                                        "entry_id": "090c221b-5989-3bd4-9b7d-740c71de482c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Deliberate misspelling of Dengist."
                                        ],
